        <body>
            <div xml:id="d535">

                <pb facs="1141" n="1045" sameAs="frus:frus1879/pg1045"/>

                <head>No. 501.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Baker to Mr. Evarts.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1879-10-28"><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 28, 1879</date>.
                        (Received November 28.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 167.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I herewith inclose a copy and translation
                    of the preliminary (Pereire) contract referred to in my number 164.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>The commissioners of the grantee, appionted to examine the situation on the
                    ground, arrived in Caracas some time since. * * *</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>JEHU BAKER.</signed></closer>





